  "description": "Construct the longest possible string given counts of 'a', 'b', and 'c' without three consecutive identical characters.",
  "target": "a:1, b:1, c:7",
  "pseudocode": "1: while (true) {\n2:   sort counts by frequency;\n3:   if (can append most frequent) {\n4:     append to result;\n5:   } else if (can append second most frequent) {\n6:     append to result;\n7:   } else break;\n8: }",
